  "prefLabel": "Jus 813.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 813.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. An agency shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus800.html"
